cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-migration-platform
powershell
git add .gitignore
powershell
git commit -m "Add .gitignore file"
powershell
git push origin main
🚨 IMPORTANT: .env File Ko Git Se Hataao
Tumhare repo me .env file galti se upload ho gayi hai (jo API keys ke liye hoti hai). Use hatana zaroori hai:

powershell
git rm --cached backend\.env
powershell
git rm --cached frontend\.env
powershell
git commit -m "Remove .env files from tracking (security)"
powershell
git push origin main
⚠️ Note: Agar error aaye "pathspec did not match" toh iska matlab .env file already tracked nahi thi. Koi baat nahi, skip karo.

🔍 .gitignore Kya Karta Hai?
Entry	Kya Ignore Karega
venv/	Python virtual environment
node_modules/	NPM packages (bahut bade)
.env	API keys (SECURITY)
*.db	Database files
__pycache__/	Python cache
dist/	Build output
.vscode/	Editor settings
*.log	Log files
uploads/*	User uploaded files
💡 Kyun .env Ignore Karna Zaroori Hai?
text
❌ GALAT: backend/.env GitHub pe upload ho gaya
   → Gemini API key public ho gayi
   → Koi bhi tumhari key use kar sakta hai
   → Tumhara bill badh sakta hai

✅ SAHI: backend/.env GitHub pe NAHI hai
   → Sirf .env.example upload hota hai
   → Actual keys local me rehti hai
   → Secure hai
📋 Complete Commands (Copy-Paste Ready)
PowerShell me ek-ek karke chalao:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-migration-platform
powershell
notepad .gitignore
(Paste karo upar wala content, save karo, close karo)

powershell
git add .gitignore
powershell
git commit -m "Add comprehensive .gitignore"
powershell
git push origin main
✅ Success Output
text
[main abc1234] Add comprehensive .gitignore
 1 file changed, 100 insertions(+)
Enumerating objects: 5, done.
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/multi-agent-migration-platform.git
   f7fda34..abc1234  main -> main
🎯 Bonus: .env.example File Bhi Banao
Ye file safe hai (isme actual keys nahi hoti, sirf placeholders).

PowerShell me:

powershell
notepad C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-migration-platform\backend\.env.example
Ye content paste karo:

env
# Gemini API Configuration
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./migration.db

# JWT Authentication
JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_key_change_this
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_HOURS=24

# File Uploads
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
OUTPUT_DIR=./outputs
MAX_UPLOAD_SIZE_MB=50

# Server
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
DEBUG=True
Save karo → Close karo.

Phir push karo:

powershell
git add backend\.env.example
git commit -m "Add .env.example template"
git push origin main
📸 Screenshot Bhejo
Push ke baad:

Browser me jao: https://github.com/vishakha2121/multi-agent-migration-platform

Check karo .gitignore dikh raha hai

Screenshot bhejo

Bhai, bas itna hi! .gitignore file banao, .env hataao, push karo. Ho gaya! 🎉💪🚀



