Migration Platform Setup
🎉 Bhai, Ho Gaya! Bas Ek Chhota Kaam Baki Hai
Dekho kya likha hai:

text
# Your branch is up to date with 'origin/main'.
# Changes to be committed:
#       modified:   README.md
Aur neeche:

text
.git/COMMIT_EDITMSG [unix] (12:23 03/10/2026)   10,1 Bot
🔍 Kya Hua?
Tumne git commit chalaya tha bina -m "message" ke. Isliye Vim editor khul gaya hai jo tumse commit message maang raha hai.

COMMIT_EDITMSG = Commit message file
[unix] = Vim editor
10,1 = Cursor position

Tum abhi Vim editor me ho. Ye terminal-based editor hai. Isse bahar nikalna hai aur properly commit karna hai.

✅ Solution - Vim Se Bahar Aao (3 Steps)
Step 1: Esc Key Dabaao
Keyboard pe Esc (Escape) key dabaao. Ye Vim ko "command mode" me le jayegi.

Step 2: Type Karo :wq Aur Enter Dabaao
:wq ka matlab:

: = command mode

w = write (save)

q = quit (exit)

Type karo: :wq phir Enter dabaao.

⚠️ Agar Ye Kaam Nahi Kare
:q! type karo aur Enter dabaao — ye bina save kiye bahar nikal dega.

text
:q!
Enter dabaao.

🎯 Phir Properly Commit Karo
Vim se bahar aane ke baad, tum wapas PowerShell me aa jaoge.

Ab ye commands ek-ek karke chalao:

powershell
git add README.md
(Enter)

powershell
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"
(Enter — dhyan do -m "message" ke saath)

powershell
git push origin main
(Enter)

📋 Aur Bhi Aasaan Tarika - Vim Avoid Karo
Vim me kabhi na phaso iske liye hamesha -m flag use karo:

powershell
git commit -m "Your message here"
Galat tarika (Vim khul jayega):

powershell
git commit
Sahi tarika (direct commit ho jayega):

powershell
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"
🚨 Vim Se Bahar Aane Ke Aur Tarike
Agar :wq kaam nahi kar raha:

Command	Kya Karega
:wq + Enter	Save karke exit
:q! + Enter	Bina save kiye exit
ZZ	Save karke exit (fast)
:x + Enter	Save karke exit
Har command se pehle Esc dabaao.

📸 Ab Kya Karo
✅ Esc dabaao

✅ :wq type karo

✅ Enter dabaao

✅ Wapas PowerShell me aa jaoge

✅ Ye chalao:

powershell
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"
powershell
git push origin main
✅ Screenshot bhejo output ka

💡 Bhai, Simple Rule Yaad Rakho
Git Commit Karne Ke 2 Tarike:

✅ Sahi Tarika (Vim Nahi Khulega):
powershell
git commit -m "message yahan likho"
❌ Galat Tarika (Vim Khul Jayega):
powershell
git commit
text
git commit -m "message likhna bhool gaya"
Bas -m "message" hamesha lagao. Vim kabhi nahi khulega.

🎯 Complete Sequence (Ek Saath)
powershell
# 1. Esc dabaao (Vim se nikalne ke liye)
# 2. :wq type karo, Enter dabaao

# 3. Phir ye chalao:
git add README.md
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"
git push origin main
✅ Success Output Aisa Aayega
text
[main abc1234] Add detailed README documentation
 1 file changed, 200 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
Enumerating objects: 5, done.
...
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/multi-agent-migration-platform.git
   f7fda34..abc1234  main -> main
Bhai, bas Esc → :wq → Enter karo. Phir proper commit chalao. Screenshot bhejo! 💪🚀

